WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.152 --> 00:00:15.235
Brad: How are we going to get to the rainbow?

2
00:00:15.255 --> 00:00:19.837
Tina: It's high above the mountain, and the mountain is so far away.

3
00:00:19.857 --> 00:00:24.178
Danny: We can get there the same way that we got down from the mountain.

4
00:00:25.178 --> 00:00:26.418
Brad: That's right.

5
00:00:26.699 --> 00:00:28.219
We'll use the hot air balloon.

6
00:00:28.299 --> 00:00:33.177
Danny: So this this is it.

7
00:00:33.997 --> 00:00:36.680
We have to say good-bye.

8
00:00:36.700 --> 00:00:39.021
Hopian: It's okay, Danny.

9
00:00:39.041 --> 00:00:41.784
Danny: I'll never forget you.

10
00:00:41.804 --> 00:00:44.766
Hopian: I'll never forget you.

11
00:00:44.786 --> 00:00:49.650
All: Bye-bye!

12
00:00:49.710 --> 00:00:54.534
Danny: It's hard to believe we're going home.

13
00:00:54.554 --> 00:00:57.897
Brad: This was the most amazing adventure.

14
00:00:57.917 --> 00:01:01.960
Tina: I'm going to miss all the excitement.

15
00:01:08.358 --> 00:01:09.199
Oh my gosh!

16
00:01:09.599 --> 00:01:10.799
Do you guys see that?

17
00:01:12.360 --> 00:01:16.242
Tina: It looks like Hopian was right.

18
00:01:16.842 --> 00:01:17.983
They won't forget us.

19
00:01:18.003 --> 00:01:20.384
Brad: Let's keep walking, guys.

20
00:01:21.064 --> 00:01:22.565
We have a long way to go.

21
00:01:22.585 --> 00:01:27.987
Tina: Ready?

22
00:01:28.788 --> 00:01:29.488
Up we go.

23
00:01:39.488 --> 00:01:42.049
Danny: The land is so beautiful from up here.

24
00:01:42.069 --> 00:01:44.691
Tina: That's where we fought Tristay.

25
00:01:45.631 --> 00:01:47.893
It's the most beautiful place of all!

26
00:01:47.993 --> 00:01:54.136
Brad: It was always a magical place, remember.

27
00:01:54.156 --> 00:01:58.198
Tina: There's the rainbow.

28
00:02:02.921 --> 00:02:04.021
We're almost there.

29
00:02:04.041 --> 00:02:05.982
Brad: Now what?

30
00:02:06.002 --> 00:02:08.444
Danny: We jump!

31
00:02:09.196 --> 00:02:16.522
Danny: Ow!

32
00:02:16.542 --> 00:02:18.584
Brad: That hurt.

33
00:02:18.644 --> 00:02:20.586
Tina: Where are we?

34
00:02:20.606 --> 00:02:25.069
Danny: We're in the bushes near the schoolyard!

35
00:02:29.993 --> 00:02:31.294
It looks like a fire drill.

36
00:02:31.314 --> 00:02:33.196
Brad: Thank goodness!

37
00:02:33.836 --> 00:02:35.498
No one will know that we've been gone.

38
00:02:35.518 --> 00:02:37.780
Danny: They will if they see us here.

39
00:02:38.348 --> 00:02:40.149
Tina: Quick, let's join a line.

40
00:02:45.052 --> 00:02:48.474
Tina: I think no one noticed.

41
00:02:48.494 --> 00:02:51.495
Danny: Our adventures are finally over.

42
00:02:51.515 --> 00:02:52.556
Brad: Shh.

43
00:02:52.796 --> 00:02:53.796
Keep quiet.

44
00:02:53.817 --> 00:02:58.079
Dave: Well, well, well.

45
00:02:58.419 --> 00:02:59.520
Look who's here!

46
00:02:59.540 --> 00:03:04.562
Chuck: It's the clay boy and his two loser friends!

47
00:03:04.582 --> 00:03:07.204
Dave: Isn't that sweet!

48
00:03:07.680 --> 00:03:11.102
The boyfriend and the girlfriend are together!

49
00:03:11.162 --> 00:03:15.684
Chuck: Are you going to ask your girlfriend to protect you again?

50
00:03:15.704 --> 00:03:22.307
Danny: I think it's time to use the clay.

51
00:03:22.327 --> 00:03:25.288
Brad: I don't think it'll be magical here, Danny.

52
00:03:25.328 --> 00:03:26.549
Danny: Trust me.

53
00:03:27.069 --> 00:03:29.630
These bullies aren't going to bother us anymore.

54
00:03:39.948 --> 00:03:42.490
Brad: Now that's using your imagination.

55
00:03:42.510 --> 00:03:44.611
Tina: That's perfect!

56
00:03:46.112 --> 00:03:51.115
Danny: I can't hear you!
